Overlay patch 0017 v2: single-flow first-run + SOH_AUTOEXTRACT.

v1 added the SOH_AUTOEXTRACT scripted path (sim ladder; idb HID dead on
iOS 27). v2 merges the iOS interactive flow into the same hunk (D6: same
region = one concern) after DEVICE feedback: the game's SDL prompt chain
(No O2R Files → Found ROM → error) stacked THREE alerts over the shell's
ROM picker, which could never be reached; answering the top chain exited
the app. On iOS the SHELL now owns all first-run UI:

- GenerateAssetsMods on __IOS__ (interactive): call the shell's
  SohIos_RunRomOnboarding() — one alert (Choose ROM… / Later), pumps the
  main runloop (SDL's own message-box pattern) until baserom.us.z64
  appears (picker or Files drop) or the user defers. Defer = clean exit
  (the alert said what to do); ROM = promptless extraction by entering
  the scripted path for exactly that window (setenv/unsetenv envelope —
  bounded so the later "Missing mods.toml" YesNo at ModManager.cpp:260
  keeps prompting normally).
- ShowMessage/ShowYesNoBox degrade to spdlog lines under SOH_AUTOEXTRACT
  (v1, unchanged). Desktop behavior unchanged.

--- a/src/engine/mods/ModManager.cpp
+++ b/src/engine/mods/ModManager.cpp
@@ -57,7 +57,44 @@
 // run: its CleanWorld() dereferences Sky::Instance and other singletons that are still null
 // at this point, which segfaults — a crash report on what should be a clean quit (e.g. when
 // the user declines the first-run "Generate one now?" prompt).
+#ifdef __IOS__
+// Overlay 0017 v2: shell-owned single-flow onboarding (SohIosShell.m D7).
+// File scope: block-scope extern "C" declarations do not compile in C++.
+extern "C" int SohIos_RunRomOnboarding(void);
+#endif
+
 void GenerateAssetsMods() {
+    // SOH_AUTOEXTRACT (overlay 0017): hands-free first-run extraction for
+    // scripted verification (sim ladder). ShowMessage/ShowYesNoBox also
+    // degrade to log lines under this env (Engine.cpp).
+    if (getenv("SOH_AUTOEXTRACT") != NULL) {
+        SPDLOG_INFO("SOH_AUTOEXTRACT: generating O2R without prompts");
+        if (!GameEngine::GenAssetFile()) {
+            SPDLOG_ERROR("SOH_AUTOEXTRACT: extraction failed");
+            _Exit(1);
+        }
+        return;
+    }
+#ifdef __IOS__
+    // Overlay 0017 v2 (device feedback 2026-07-11): the SDL prompt chain
+    // stacked three alerts over the shell's ROM picker. The shell owns ALL
+    // first-run UI: one alert, then promptless extraction.
+    {
+        if (!SohIos_RunRomOnboarding()) {
+            SPDLOG_INFO("iOS onboarding: user deferred (Files drop later); exiting cleanly");
+            _Exit(0);
+        }
+        SPDLOG_INFO("iOS onboarding: ROM ready, extracting");
+        setenv("SOH_AUTOEXTRACT", "1", 1); // promptless window (boxes -> logs)
+        const bool sohExtractOk = GameEngine::GenAssetFile();
+        unsetenv("SOH_AUTOEXTRACT"); // bounded: later prompts (mods.toml) stay interactive
+        if (!sohExtractOk) {
+            SPDLOG_ERROR("iOS onboarding: extraction failed");
+            _Exit(1);
+        }
+        return;
+    }
+#endif
     if (GameEngine::ShowYesNoBox("No O2R Files", "No O2R files found. Generate one now?") == IDYES) {
         if (!GameEngine::GenAssetFile()) {
             GameEngine::ShowMessage("Error", "An error occured, no O2R file was generated.\n\nExiting...");
